control: A stored gate skip the gate no longer decides as the same skip returns to pending at backfill's run-start step
removes: the run-start step reads the gate skips and returns none to pending, so every skip made under earlier thresholds stays in force
packages: ./worker/internal/backfill ./worker/internal/backfill/pass2
tests: TestAChangeOfThresholdsDecidesTheStoredSkipsAgain
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

